-- The paper's T3 pair: two interpreters over a five-constructor object
-- type differing in one equation.  `step` and the fuel loop are generated for
-- both cores; the outcome type is the first outcome-shaped declaration
-- and the result type the last.
term5 === S | K | I | App term5 term5 | Err
outcome === Stepped term5 | Done | Errd
result === RVal term5 | RErr | RTime

omega = S I I (S I I)

wf5Abs := { stepErr acc = Errd }
wf5Omg := { stepErr acc = omega }
